Description: AMD/Xilinx XDMA PCIe reference driver source for DKMS
 This package provides the AMD/Xilinx XDMA PCIe reference driver source
 for use with DKMS. DKMS rebuilds the xdma kernel module when supported
 kernels are installed or upgraded.
 .
 The package also installs a restricted udev rule for /dev/xdma* devices
 and configures the module to load at the next system boot.
